      <info>Arla röd mjölk (standardmjölk) 
Confidence: high
This is standard Swedish whole milk (3% fat, 'röd mjölk'). Macros are based on the detailed label and typical dairy composition: all carbohydrate is lactose, with trace amounts of other sugars. ButterFat equals TotalFat. MSNF (milk solids non-fat) is calculated as 100 - water - fat; water is ~87.9%. Ash is typical for milk. No added sugars, fiber, or cocoa. Vitamin D is as per Swedish fortification. Sodium is calculated from salt. Trace trans fat is present in natural milk fat.</info>
